        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Design and background formed by looped woolen weft.  Warp and weft of foundation fabric linen or hemp.  Ground of mainfield dark blue.  Design: jar of flowers woven with pink, cream, and a little yellow and green, with cream white bird in each corner, surrounded by border with dark blue vine on pink ground, edged with red and white fringe."@en ;
